  "changes": [
    "Nonblocking durable PostQuestion and asker-only CancelQuestion share the normal question/inbox lifecycle.",
    "Persist provider question routes and prepared responses; acknowledge human answers only after exact provider request resolution.",
    "Require the daemon closure and exact accepted answer ID; cancelled and expired replies cannot grant approval.",
    "Keep late replies to retained questions unapplied; persist retired question IDs so older replies pause in the queue instead of becoming model input.",
    "Blocking Ask also requires committed question closure; empty questions reject before registering a human.",
    "Lost question events and uncertain restart outcomes pause delivery without automatic approval replay."
  ],
